  Mode: 114
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Snap
  Description: 'Goby and Pistol only - a hunt through a ball of kelp. From the Goby, dart from strand
    to strand and lock a rival pilot. From the Pistol, ride the islands the Goby lays and
    fire a vortex ring when the locked rival is on your screen - it homes on them, and every
    ring hit is a point that takes their petals. Higher intensities thicken the kelp, thin
    the herds and crystals, and add danger tips and collars. First team to the target wins.'
